{"id":"ballon","lemma":"Ballon","pos":"noun","rank":4872,"glosses":["balloon"],"ipa":"/baˈlɔŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/61/De-Ballon.ogg/De-Ballon.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Ballons","plural":"Ballons"},"formAudio":{"Ballons":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Ballons.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich möchte den roten Ballon.","en":"I want the red balloon.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"red","l":"rot"},null]},{"text":"Der Ballon ist mit Luft gefüllt.","en":"The balloon is filled with air.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"air, atmosphere"},{"g":"stuffed, filled"}]},{"text":"Ein Ballon schwebte in der Luft.","en":"A balloon was floating in the air.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to hover","l":"schweben"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"air, atmosphere"}]},{"text":"Am Himmel fliegt ein bunter Ballon.","en":"A colorful balloon is floating in the sky.","words":[{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"sky"},{"g":"to fly","l":"fliegen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"multi-colored","l":"bunt"},null]},{"text":"Der Ballon erhob sich langsam.","en":"The balloon went up slowly.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to raise, lift","l":"erheben"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"slowly"}]}]}